---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service" description="Terms of Service for DailyDialz software and website.">
  <section class="bg-bg px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose-legal mx-auto max-w-[760px]">
      <p class="mono-label">LEGAL</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-[40px] font-bold text-text sm:text-[48px]">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: August 3, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Agreement Summary</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing this website or purchasing a DailyDialz license, you agree to these Terms. DailyDialz is calling-workflow
        software for compatible Android devices. It is not a telecommunications carrier, VoIP provider, or legal advisory service.
      </p>

      <h2>2. License & Updates</h2>
      <p>
        A paid Solo founder license grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable (except as allowed in writing)
        right to use the purchased version of the software for outbound calling workflows on a compatible device, subject to
        these Terms and any license terms shown at checkout.
      </p>
      <p>
        Purchases include {site.updatesMonths} months of updates from the purchase date unless otherwise stated at checkout.
        After the included update period, the purchased version remains usable under the license terms; continued new feature
        updates may require optional maintenance if offered.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
