        the software—only a license to use it. You may not reverse engineer, resell, or redistribute the software except as
        permitted by law or written agreement.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Acceptable Use & Client Responsibilities</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>You are responsible for complying with all applicable telemarketing, consent, do-not-call, recording, privacy, and carrier rules.</li>
        <li>You must not use DailyDialz for unlawful harassment, fraud, or spam.</li>
        <li>You are responsible for the accuracy of lists you import and for securing your device.</li>
        <li>You acknowledge that call behavior can vary by OEM, Android version, multi-SIM configuration, and carrier.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Support & Maintenance</h2>
      <p>
        Standard support during the included update window is provided on a commercially reasonable basis via{" "}
        {site.email}. Response times are not guaranteed unless a separate support agreement says otherwise.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, DailyDialz and its operators are not liable for indirect, incidental, special,
        consequential, or punitive damages, or for lost profits, lost deals, or business interruption. Total liability for any
        claim related to the software or site is limited to the amount you paid for the license in the twelve months before the
        claim.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms are governed by the laws of the jurisdiction designated by the operator at checkout or in an updated
        policy, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Venue for disputes will be the courts of that jurisdiction unless
        mandatory consumer protections require otherwise.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a class="text-text underline decoration-border underline-offset-4" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
  <CtaBand />
</BaseLayout>
